# Pelagornis Styleguide

- Preserve the existing project architecture and conventions.
- Keep shared Skills in `.agents/skills/`.
- Do not create duplicate editable Skills in `.cursor/skills/`.
- Use relevant Skills for reusable workflows.
- Run relevant validation before reporting completion.
